WEBVTT

00:12.846 --> 00:14.305
When I was in third grade,

00:14.389 --> 00:17.142
I beat up a high school student
who was being arrogant.

00:17.225 --> 00:18.143
WRITING, MATHEMATICS

00:22.063 --> 00:25.734
He may be older than me,
but arrogance is arrogance.

00:26.359 --> 00:28.653
When others look down on me…

00:31.823 --> 00:34.534
and I can feel that they
are looking down on me,

00:34.617 --> 00:37.912
the bell that indicates
the start of a fight starts ringing.

00:38.830 --> 00:40.707
It's nothing interesting, really.

00:40.790 --> 00:44.586
Beating up a boring guy
is still going to be boring.

00:47.881 --> 00:48.882
What?

00:51.509 --> 00:53.303
What kind of woman…

00:54.220 --> 00:55.513
do you like?

00:56.765 --> 00:58.433
Who are you?

01:00.310 --> 01:02.562
I had a feeling that…

01:02.645 --> 01:04.647
I wouldn't feel bored anymore.

02:47.876 --> 02:50.795
It's time to unleash my cursed technique.

02:50.879 --> 02:51.754
What?

02:51.838 --> 02:53.381
Didn't you use it before?

02:53.464 --> 02:57.552
However, I don't have time
to explain it in detail now.

02:57.635 --> 03:00.680
I can only tell you one thing…

03:01.264 --> 03:02.348
Don't stop.

03:03.016 --> 03:04.434
Believe in me!

03:05.560 --> 03:06.728
Only two things, right?

03:09.147 --> 03:11.274
Let me review its moves.

03:12.275 --> 03:14.527
Roots emerge from the ground.

03:14.611 --> 03:18.072
I believe that the smaller the scale,

03:18.156 --> 03:20.074
the stronger and faster it would be.

03:20.658 --> 03:21.951
Wooden Ball.

03:22.035 --> 03:25.121
Each Wooden Ball can launch
one or two attacks.

03:25.204 --> 03:26.915
Then it will disappear.

03:26.998 --> 03:29.959
I need to watch the time gap
since it can be controlled midair.

03:30.043 --> 03:31.461
Cursed Bud.

03:31.544 --> 03:33.963
I think Fushiguro got hit by that.

03:34.047 --> 03:36.382
Will it be over
if they plant it into someone?

03:36.466 --> 03:39.219
If so, I hope there's a limit
to how many it can use.

03:39.719 --> 03:40.887
Flower Field.

03:40.970 --> 03:43.097
It can distract his opponents.

03:43.181 --> 03:45.433
But my injury is making me focus better.

03:45.516 --> 03:47.227
I don't need to be too wary of that.

03:47.310 --> 03:50.730
Not to forget the left arm it revealed.

03:52.857 --> 03:56.236
Also, the possibility that
everything could be a disguise!

03:56.319 --> 03:58.488
But regardless of its cursed technique,

03:58.571 --> 04:01.032
I'll just prevent it from using it.

04:02.075 --> 04:04.369
Considering this
is an emergency situation,

04:04.452 --> 04:07.497
my IQ of 530,000…

04:10.083 --> 04:14.087
and my CPU brain has concluded
that the outcome should be…

04:20.093 --> 04:23.304
Why? Because I'm not alone.

04:26.099 --> 04:27.892
Because you're here!

04:29.435 --> 04:30.270
What?

04:37.360 --> 04:38.194
Todo!

04:44.784 --> 04:45.868
Todo!

04:48.371 --> 04:50.290
First one down.

04:59.841 --> 05:01.467
What…

05:01.551 --> 05:02.677
What?

05:02.760 --> 05:03.761
Todo!

05:03.845 --> 05:05.388
I see.

05:05.471 --> 05:07.056
It's so simple.

05:08.558 --> 05:11.185
Therefore, it's a troublesome
cursed technique.

05:11.269 --> 05:16.232
Yes, my cursed technique allows me
to trade places with someone else.

05:16.316 --> 05:17.692
Boogie Woogie!

05:19.569 --> 05:20.862
Todo.

05:21.738 --> 05:24.324
Eliminate the opponent first
before it adjusts to it.

05:27.702 --> 05:33.333
By the way,
clapping is the way to activate it!

05:47.263 --> 05:49.057
Their physical differences…

05:49.140 --> 05:51.350
feel more significant
after trading places.

05:54.604 --> 05:59.025
Am I the object of the trade,
or is it Sukuna's vessel?

05:59.525 --> 06:02.070
When he claps his hand,
I'm forced to choose either one.

06:02.153 --> 06:03.821
It slows down my judgment.

06:09.285 --> 06:11.412
Not good. This is…

06:29.472 --> 06:31.432
I can't escape!

06:37.772 --> 06:39.273
It's coming again!

06:42.527 --> 06:45.696
Continuous use of Black Flash
isn't amazing at all.

06:49.617 --> 06:52.286
It is hard to use it more than twice

06:52.370 --> 06:55.456
unless unleashed consecutively
on the same day.

06:55.540 --> 06:59.585
The reason behind the first success
might be one's luck or capability.

06:59.669 --> 07:01.337
After using Black Flash,

07:01.420 --> 07:06.467
a sorcerer will enter the zone,
similar to what athletes experience.

07:06.551 --> 07:12.348
The thinking process revolving around
sorcery becomes as easy as breathing.

07:12.432 --> 07:15.518
You feel like
you're the center of everything,

07:15.601 --> 07:17.311
and that you're omnipotent.

07:17.812 --> 07:19.981
I guess it can be described like this?

07:21.232 --> 07:23.484
My record, you ask?

07:26.654 --> 07:28.030
Four times.

07:28.614 --> 07:30.992
It was just pure luck.

07:37.415 --> 07:38.708
Black Flash!

07:39.208 --> 07:40.376
Brother.

07:40.460 --> 07:43.129
You always give me this premonition.

07:51.304 --> 07:52.263
Black Flash.

07:57.560 --> 07:58.519
Black Flash.

07:59.103 --> 08:01.022
Three times in a row.

08:01.606 --> 08:03.274
Don't get ahead of yourself!

08:05.943 --> 08:06.986
Trading places?

08:07.069 --> 08:09.113
I should be careful of…

08:09.655 --> 08:11.032
Sukuna's…

08:12.950 --> 08:14.243
They didn't change places!

08:18.748 --> 08:23.252
Clapping my hands doesn't mean
that I'll activate the cursed technique.

08:23.336 --> 08:27.006
It's simple, but you fell for it.

08:27.507 --> 08:29.425
It's the same as before.

08:30.384 --> 08:33.221
I have a feeling that
I wouldn't feel bored anymore!

08:38.100 --> 08:39.894
Black Flash.

00:09:32.770 --> 00:09:34.480
It attacked right after the switch.

00:09:34.564 --> 00:09:37.858
Looks like it's getting used to
Todo's cursed technique.

00:09:38.484 --> 00:09:41.988
But the continuous Black Flash
just now was effective.

00:09:42.488 --> 00:09:45.116
Both of us can exorcise it!

00:09:46.200 --> 00:09:50.246
This is the first time in my life
I've suffered such a serious injury.

00:09:50.955 --> 00:09:53.124
Even so…

00:09:55.042 --> 00:09:58.629
The thrill of fighting
has not disappeared!

00:10:16.606 --> 00:10:19.233
The explanation of his
cursed technique seems phony.

00:10:19.775 --> 00:10:23.529
Can he trade other people's places
besides himself?

00:10:23.613 --> 00:10:24.864
Todo!

00:10:25.698 --> 00:10:27.783
He tried to protect me…

00:10:27.867 --> 00:10:30.536
Don't worry, brother.

00:10:31.287 --> 00:10:35.041
If I defend with my body
and cursed energy,

00:10:35.625 --> 00:10:37.460
this level of Cursed Buds…

00:10:37.960 --> 00:10:40.254
I'll deflect them all.

00:10:46.260 --> 00:10:47.970
Are you sure?

00:10:50.931 --> 00:10:53.309
Takada?

00:10:54.935 --> 00:10:58.731
Do you remember Fushiguro's wound?

00:10:58.814 --> 00:11:00.483
Of course!

00:11:00.566 --> 00:11:03.736
My opponent is shooting
Cursed Buds at me now.

00:11:03.819 --> 00:11:04.862
That's why I…

00:11:04.945 --> 00:11:06.197
However,

00:11:06.697 --> 00:11:10.117
the buds inside Fushiguro
grew a little, right?

00:11:13.954 --> 00:11:17.208
Did it grow because it absorbed his blood?

00:11:17.291 --> 00:11:19.210
It could be.

00:11:19.293 --> 00:11:21.879
But his opponent was a Cursed Spirit.

00:11:22.463 --> 00:11:25.049
What is the most possible reason?

00:11:29.887 --> 00:11:31.347
Cursed energy.

00:11:31.430 --> 00:11:32.848
TOOK PLACE FOR 0.01 SECONDS

00:11:40.064 --> 00:11:42.274
He withdrew his cursed energy
at the last moment!

00:11:42.358 --> 00:11:43.526
Did he find out about it?

00:11:44.110 --> 00:11:46.821
The stronger the protective cursed energy,

00:11:46.904 --> 00:11:49.198
the bigger the Cursed Buds will grow.

00:11:49.865 --> 00:11:52.368
Is the NHE coming soon?

00:11:52.451 --> 00:11:54.370
NHE, NATIONAL HANDSHAKE EVENT

00:11:54.453 --> 00:11:56.789
I must express my gratitude to her.

00:11:57.373 --> 00:11:58.457
Right?

00:12:08.008 --> 00:12:09.927
Special Grade Cursed Spirit.

00:12:10.970 --> 00:12:15.266
You should have noticed
that my explanation was incomplete.

00:12:15.891 --> 00:12:20.646
But you still need
to consider one more thing.

00:12:20.729 --> 00:12:23.566
That is the target of Boogie Woogie.

00:12:24.900 --> 00:12:29.780
Can I only switch the positions
of living creatures within my range?

00:12:31.282 --> 00:12:35.369
My cursed technique works on anything,
including Cursed Corpses!

00:12:35.453 --> 00:12:37.329
So the answer is…

00:12:37.955 --> 00:12:41.125
it works on anything
with enough cursed energy!

00:12:43.919 --> 00:12:46.714
Special Grade Cursed Spirit,
have you noticed?

00:12:47.840 --> 00:12:51.427
We're back to the same place.

00:12:51.510 --> 00:12:54.597
That thing is sleeping inside!

00:13:00.269 --> 00:13:03.481
Maki's Special Grade Cursed Tool
is under the river.

00:13:04.440 --> 00:13:07.067
The tree branches on its face
are particularly fragile.

00:13:10.404 --> 00:13:11.739
The river?

00:13:12.448 --> 00:13:15.284
What did I switch positions with?

00:13:17.119 --> 00:13:19.121
Special Grade Cursed Tool.

00:13:25.920 --> 00:13:27.213
Playful Cloud!

00:13:35.471 --> 00:13:38.933
I imbued my cursed energy
on this Special Grade Cursed Tool,

00:13:39.016 --> 00:13:40.809
but I still can't exorcise it.

00:13:40.893 --> 00:13:41.894
What?

00:13:54.073 --> 00:13:57.243
Plants cannot breed cursed energy.

00:13:57.826 --> 00:14:01.497
My left hand can absorb
life from other plants

00:14:02.122 --> 00:14:04.625
and convert it into cursed energy.

00:14:06.085 --> 00:14:09.380
The cursed energy won't recharge my body.

00:14:09.463 --> 00:14:12.508
However, it will flow into this flower.

00:14:12.591 --> 00:14:15.594
I didn't want to use this, if possible.

00:14:24.103 --> 00:14:25.104
Todo!

00:14:25.187 --> 00:14:26.480
Don't come here, brother!

00:14:26.564 --> 00:14:28.774
This output of cursed energy
is extraordinary.

00:14:28.857 --> 00:14:33.612
It's easy for you to avoid it
using your cursed technique.

00:14:34.113 --> 00:14:36.407
In that case, what should I do?

00:14:37.575 --> 00:14:39.159
Domain--

00:14:41.996 --> 00:14:42.997
The Veil…

00:15:10.608 --> 00:15:12.276
I see.

00:15:12.776 --> 00:15:16.030
I was wondering how can he be
so loud without loudspeakers.

00:15:16.697 --> 00:15:19.366
This old man is a loudspeaker himself.

00:15:19.450 --> 00:15:24.371
His cursed technique amplifies
the music he plays and launches it.

00:15:25.247 --> 00:15:27.625
A predictable mid-range fighter.

00:15:27.708 --> 00:15:30.544
He obviously doesn't want me
to go near him.

00:15:33.255 --> 00:15:35.215
I'll make a wallet then.

00:15:35.299 --> 00:15:37.927
A wallet filled with an old man's smell.

00:15:44.016 --> 00:15:45.184
Understood.

00:15:45.267 --> 00:15:47.603
Go and meet with Shoko, Nishimiya.

00:15:50.105 --> 00:15:53.025
It's okay, Mei Mei will look after Miwa.

00:15:56.278 --> 00:15:58.322
Luckily, reception is still
working on phones.

00:15:58.405 --> 00:16:01.200
This is normal
due to the nature of the Veil.

00:16:01.909 --> 00:16:03.452
Someone in Jujutsu High School…

00:16:03.535 --> 00:16:06.330
is colluding with
Cursed Users or Cursed Spirits.

00:16:07.623 --> 00:16:09.833
Looks like it's not a misunderstanding.

00:16:11.835 --> 00:16:12.670
What?

00:16:16.256 --> 00:16:19.051
I thought I got you.

00:16:20.010 --> 00:16:21.303
A human?

00:16:21.929 --> 00:16:23.013
Is he a Curse User?

00:16:25.265 --> 00:16:27.309
This is why…

00:16:30.145 --> 00:16:32.606
Looks pretty good, right?

00:16:34.066 --> 00:16:36.402
Juzo made this for me.

00:16:37.403 --> 00:16:39.154
Didn't you see him just now?

00:16:40.322 --> 00:16:44.660
You are weak,
so let the katana support you.

00:16:45.244 --> 00:16:46.286
That's what he said.

00:16:48.998 --> 00:16:52.584
What can you give me, miss?

00:16:53.127 --> 00:16:55.921
-You're not popular with girls, right?
-What?

00:16:56.005 --> 00:16:59.425
We've only just met,
and you keep talking about yourself.

00:17:00.050 --> 00:17:01.260
I'm charging you money.

00:17:01.343 --> 00:17:05.472
Are you qualified to charge people
for being their listener?

00:17:06.265 --> 00:17:09.226
-You guys!
-Shut up! Don't argue with me!

00:17:09.309 --> 00:17:10.144
What?

00:17:10.853 --> 00:17:12.271
Gosh!

00:17:12.354 --> 00:17:16.400
There are so many girls! I'm so popular!

00:17:17.192 --> 00:17:19.319
Are you listening to us?

00:17:19.403 --> 00:17:21.280
I'll be the support.

00:17:21.363 --> 00:17:23.532
Be careful not to get shot by mistake.

00:17:23.615 --> 00:17:25.492
You should be careful!

00:17:33.083 --> 00:17:34.501
The Veil is lifted?

00:17:35.085 --> 00:17:39.214
Really? It's not even 30 minutes.

00:17:39.298 --> 00:17:40.716
I'm running!

00:17:42.509 --> 00:17:45.262
What's wrong with him?

00:17:48.182 --> 00:17:51.060
Hey!

00:17:52.978 --> 00:17:56.607
The dazzling clothing rack
is right in front of my eyes.

00:17:59.443 --> 00:18:00.778
Now then…

00:18:00.861 --> 00:18:02.696
Where should I start?

00:18:06.241 --> 00:18:07.493
Is that…

00:18:12.414 --> 00:18:15.292
Seems like this is as far as we get.

00:18:15.918 --> 00:18:16.752
What?

00:18:16.835 --> 00:18:18.295
Mr. Gojo?

00:18:27.179 --> 00:18:28.555
Yuji's level…

00:18:29.431 --> 00:18:31.558
He has greatly improved.

00:18:32.559 --> 00:18:34.895
I see. It must be Aoi.

00:18:35.395 --> 00:18:37.898
He really works well with Yuji.

00:18:38.440 --> 00:18:40.818
Looks like they are fighting
a Special Grade.

00:18:40.901 --> 00:18:42.569
I shouldn't worry about them.

00:18:43.612 --> 00:18:46.198
In that case, my priority would be…

00:18:48.492 --> 00:18:49.660
You.

00:18:50.244 --> 00:18:53.247
Clothing rack!

00:18:53.330 --> 00:18:55.124
Don't kill him!

00:19:05.008 --> 00:19:07.469
I have many questions to ask him.

00:19:08.428 --> 00:19:10.305
Don't let him die.

00:19:10.389 --> 00:19:11.974
Come on, heal him.

00:19:17.062 --> 00:19:20.649
The Curse User who attacked
Utahime has disappeared.

00:19:21.817 --> 00:19:23.986
Were they planning to escape all along?

00:19:24.987 --> 00:19:26.864
Is that the only one left?

00:19:27.447 --> 00:19:29.116
That one is good at escaping, too.

00:19:30.325 --> 00:19:32.703
This place is quite far away from Yuji.

00:19:33.203 --> 00:19:34.788
I have no choice.

00:19:35.455 --> 00:19:37.457
Let's be a little violent.

00:19:38.542 --> 00:19:40.961
Cursed Technique Lapse, Blue.

00:19:41.461 --> 00:19:43.714
Cursed Technique Reversal, Red.

00:19:47.718 --> 00:19:48.969
I'm withdrawing.

00:19:49.052 --> 00:19:52.639
I'm not conceited enough to believe
that I can take on Satoru Gojo.

00:19:52.723 --> 00:19:53.891
Are you serious?

00:19:53.974 --> 00:19:56.518
What are you trying to do?

00:19:57.519 --> 00:19:59.146
Wait a minute, brother!

00:19:59.229 --> 00:20:01.231
Todo, why are you stopping me?

00:20:03.025 --> 00:20:04.902
Don't get any closer.

00:20:08.488 --> 00:20:10.157
You'll be swept into it.

00:20:13.994 --> 00:20:15.162
Hollow…

00:20:18.540 --> 00:20:19.750
Purple.

00:20:46.693 --> 00:20:48.946
He's still beyond common sense, as always.

00:20:49.029 --> 00:20:50.280
Gosh…

00:20:51.156 --> 00:20:54.493
I can't even tell if the Cursed Spirit
was exorcised or not.

00:20:55.369 --> 00:20:57.246
It hurts!

00:20:57.329 --> 00:20:58.872
It hurts so much!

00:20:58.956 --> 00:21:00.040
Shut up!

00:21:00.123 --> 00:21:01.583
All right!

00:21:01.667 --> 00:21:03.627
Everything's resolved!

00:21:05.212 --> 00:21:08.006
Of course, it's not that simple.

00:21:17.015 --> 00:21:19.059
I wonder if Hanami is okay.

00:21:20.143 --> 00:21:22.479
Mission accomplished.

00:22:56.448 --> 00:22:58.366
-Juju Stroll.
-Salmon.

00:22:58.450 --> 00:22:59.993
ARE YOU A DOG OR A CAT PERSON?

00:23:00.577 --> 00:23:01.620
I'm a dog person.

00:23:02.245 --> 00:23:04.664
No, maybe I'm a cat person.

00:23:05.165 --> 00:23:07.834
Wait a minute.
I'll choose dog if it's a large one.

00:23:08.752 --> 00:23:09.586
Dogs.

00:23:09.669 --> 00:23:11.379
I think dogs.

00:23:11.463 --> 00:23:13.632
What? I'm definitely a cat person.

00:23:14.216 --> 00:23:15.175
Salmon.

00:23:15.258 --> 00:23:19.262
Of course, I'm a panda person!
Do you want me to kill you?

00:23:20.847 --> 00:23:26.895
Does everyone dislike me?

00:23:26.978 --> 00:23:29.397
No. It's just that
there are only two options.

00:23:29.481 --> 00:23:30.857
Ignore him.

00:23:35.904 --> 00:23:37.364
NOBARA KUGISAKI, THIRD BASEMAN
